  },
  data: {
    LLM: '1. **Ante**: All players post the ante. 2. **Market Setup**: Dealer turns up two cards and places them beside the deck. 3. **Buy Phase**: Starting left of dealer, each player buys one card from the market (face-up) or stock (top card, revealed on purchase). 4. **Refill**: Purchased market cards are replaced immediately from the stock. 5. **Bet Phase**: After each buy round, a standard betting round. 6. **Repetition**: Buy/bet sequence repeats 5 times until each player has 5 cards. 7. **Declaration**: Active players secret-declare High, Low, or Both using chips in hand. 8. **Showdown**: Cards revealed; pot split per declarations.',
    Player: '1. **Ante**: All players post the ante. 2. **Market Setup**: Dealer turns up two cards and places them beside the deck. 3. **Buy Phase**: Starting left of dealer, each player buys one card from the market (face-up) or stock (top card, revealed on purchase). 4. **Refill**: Purchased market cards are replaced immediately from the stock. 5. **Bet Phase**: After each buy round, a standard betting round. 6. **Repetition**: Buy/bet sequence repeats 5 times until each player has 5 cards. 7. **Declaration**: Active players secret-declare High, Low, or Both using chips in hand. 8. **Showdown**: Cards revealed; pot split per declarations.',
    objective: 'Win the pot by having the highest or lowest hand (or both) at the showdown.',
    gameplay: '1. **Ante**: All players post the ante. 2. **Market Setup**: Dealer turns up two cards and places them beside the deck. 3. **Buy Phase**: Starting left of dealer, each player buys one card from the market (face-up) or stock (top card, revealed on purchase). 4. **Refill**: Purchased market cards are replaced immediately from the stock. 5. **Bet Phase**: After each buy round, a standard betting round. 6. **Repetition**: Buy/bet sequence repeats 5 times until each player has 5 cards. 7. **Declaration**: Active players secret-declare High, Low, or Both using chips in hand. 8. **Showdown**: Cards revealed; pot split per declarations.',
    keyRules: [
      'Market cards cost based on rank: 2-5 (2u), 6-K (1u), Ace (4u).',
      'Cards bought from the stock are revealed to the table immediately.',
      'Market purchases remain face-up if taken from the market row.',
      "Pig Rule: If declaring 'Both', you must win both High and Low halves solo or win nothing.",
      'Each player must buy exactly one card per buy phase (mandatory).',
    ],
    bonusRuleGuids: [],
